{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft your mobile base</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593980/extras/f07ef22bb3c5abd021544ef9d6a38165.poster.avif?t=1771891612\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593980/extras/f07ef22bb3c5abd021544ef9d6a38165.webm?t=1771891612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593980/extras/f07ef22bb3c5abd021544ef9d6a38165.mp4?t=1771891612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest, craft, and build with tactile hand controls, turning raw materials into dwarven masterpieces that unlock new frontiers. Pack up your whole base\u2014shrunk to fit in your bag\u2014and hit the rails to chase adventure. In Trainfort, staying mobile isn\u2019t just fun, it\u2019s survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore , Gather , Upgrade</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593980/extras/ced713dc46f6c7de7c893d0fd9f90375.poster.avif?t=1771891612\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593980/extras/ced713dc46f6c7de7c893d0fd9f90375.webm?t=1771891612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593980/extras/ced713dc46f6c7de7c893d0fd9f90375.mp4?t=1771891612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <br>Journey through fields, deserts, and infested forests, building grand steam engines to conquer the wildstrains. Infested zones challenge you with toxic gas, deadly monsters, and time limits, but offer special structures and technologies. Resources dwindle if you stay put, so roll on, dwarf!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work together</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593980/extras/e70643c164a2c17e6e76fe94a291e4d3.poster.avif?t=1771891612\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593980/extras/e70643c164a2c17e6e76fe94a291e4d3.webm?t=1771891612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593980/extras/e70643c164a2c17e6e76fe94a291e4d3.mp4?t=1771891612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>Venture into the world solo or band with three other dwarven pals for co-op chaos. Clean infested area during the day, fend off nightly zombie swarms. Shapes your legend in the wild wastes !<strong> </strong>   <br>   <br><strong>Hands-On, For Real</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593980/extras/c6005be5595967db690b1f5ab03dc3d2.poster.avif?t=1771891612\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593980/extras/c6005be5595967db690b1f5ab03dc3d2.webm?t=1771891612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593980/extras/c6005be5595967db690b1f5ab03dc3d2.mp4?t=1771891612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hands are the interface. From looting debris to slotting tools on your belt or fighting off a zombie with an axe, everything you do is physical. The result? A looting and crafting experience that feels grounded, intentional, and unlike anything else.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2593980?t=1771891612","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2593980?t=1771891612","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593980/13a43c4dbd4fcc33a536be75dbda0284e73c76f0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771891612","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593980/13a43c4dbd4fcc33a536be75dbda0284e73c76f0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771891612","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft your mobile base</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593980/extras/f07ef22bb3c5abd021544ef9d6a38165.poster.avif?t=1771891612\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593980/extras/f07ef22bb3c5abd021544ef9d6a38165.webm?t=1771891612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593980/extras/f07ef22bb3c5abd021544ef9d6a38165.mp4?t=1771891612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest, craft, and build with tactile hand controls, turning raw materials into dwarven masterpieces that unlock new frontiers. Pack up your whole base\u2014shrunk 