t-apocalyptic world with your bearded mates. Build a moving steam engine, pack your base with you, and explore the wilderness. The country is big, your legs are short, but you gotta keep moving!","steam_appid":2593980,"support_info":{"email":"trainfort.itch@tinybuild.com","url":"https://www.tinybuild.com/"},"supported_languages":"English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese","type":"game","website":null}